    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "RISK FACTORS In addition to other information included or incorporated by reference in this joint proxy statement/prospectus and in the annexes to this joint proxy statement/prospectus, including the matters addressed in the section entitled \u201cCautionary Statement Regarding Forward-Looking Statements\u201d beginning on page 54, you should carefully consider the following risk factors in deciding whether to vote for the MITT Common Stock Issuance Proposal or the CHMI Merger Proposal and the other related matters described in this joint proxy statement/prospectus.  In addition, you should read and consider the risks associated with the businesses of each of MITT and CHMI.  The risks associated with the business of MITT can be found in its Annual Report on Form 10-K for the year ended December 31, 2025, Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, and other reports of MITT, ",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
